flowchart TD
 A([Cart ready]) --> B[/Enter payment/]
 B --> C{Fields and payment valid?}
 C -- No --> I[/Reject/]
 I --> B
 C -- Yes --> D[(Save transaction)]
 D --> E{Write succeeded?}
 E -- No --> J[/Stop on quota error/]
 J --> H([End])
 E -- Yes --> F[Deduct stock and save products]
 F --> K[No final live-stock check; product failure ignored]
 F --> G[/Clear cart, show receipt and success/]
 G --> H
